  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Armenia and Azerbaijan - Delivering on the Promise of Peace and Information Integrity and Security</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This action will respond to urgent needs of support for normalisation and peace process between Armenia and Azerbaijan, as well as boost Armenia&#xbf;s resilience against hybrid threats. Assistance will be implemented via two components. The first component will focus on supporting tangible benefits of peace and pro-regional integration agenda. The action will deliver practical assistance for building community trust, dealing with legacies of the conflict and making use of new opportunities for cross-border confidence building measures. In Armenia this will include facilitating the demining process in conflict-impacted areas along the demarcation line. The second component aims to increase Armenia&#xbf;s resilience to hybrid threats. This will include targeted support to countering foreign information manipulation and interference (FIMI) and cyberattacks as relevant.</narrative>
  </description>
